    },
    {
      "commit": "27b2ed4395fee26da2309b2bc7c358653e43d14d",
      "disposition": "reconciled-to-lts",
      "rationale": "Complete thirteen-file refresh and all documentation examined. Native fscrypt mode selection/DUN comments and block-based DIO limit supersede the page-based helper. Native ext4/F2FS show inlinecrypt locally; proc_namespace does not duplicate it. Native F2FS IPU submission checks physical mergeability before reuse and retains matching crypto indices for submitted folios. All four current UFS source/header files equal pinned LTS: native capability initialization, noncrypto management commands, descriptor preparation and fatal-error handling remain. The historical program_key variant callback is superseded by the native custom crypto-profile model; no old callback or platform driver is added. Native docs retain inlinecrypt/testing guidance; this review did not execute those tests.",
